        "slc_49e0e4b93edf59c25539c71bba6c8dd97ae0343404e84617f64f45f77c936986"
      ],
      "text": "For GPT/Codex models, a smaller tool ABI (bash, apply_patch, view_image, exec) is exposed; exec composes host tools inside QuickJS while permissions and side effects remain under host control."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
