        "slc_d46b5e4805456886fc02c145b66d723e257dfd36a4028278e6871636162786b6"
      ],
      "text": "The GPT profile is enabled when the model ID contains 'gpt-' (excluding 'oss' and 'gpt-4') and hides overlapping read/write/edit/grep/glob tools; prompt routing and tool profiles use separate string rules not yet unified."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_9ec3c9d8c154fe705756b3126d4cc1c602d52c637b48deb43ba3b143e9817255",
